{"sha": "41036e52d7892a6d460ff4b41e99eba5826a8203e837fdedaa7bc9594808a81d", "body": ["\\section{\\texorpdfstring{$\\R$}{R} 上的勒贝格测度}", "", "\\begin{definition}\\label{def:b3:measure:lebesgueouter}", "集合 $A", "\\subseteq \\R$ 的\\emph{勒贝格外测度}\\index{勒贝格测度}为", "\\[", "\\lambda^*(A) = \\inf\\Bigl\\{\\sum_{n} (b_n - a_n) :", "A \\subseteq \\bigcup_n \\intoo{a_n}{b_n}\\Bigr\\}", "\\]", "（可数个开区间覆盖）。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{lemma}\\label{lem:b3:measure:outerbasics}", "$\\lambda^*$ 是外测度，关于平移不变，", "且 $\\lambda^*(I) = \\ell(I)$（即长度），对每个区间", "$I$ 成立。", "\\end{lemma}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "外测度：$\\varnothing$ 可被任意小的", "区间覆盖；单调性显然；次可加性：取定", "各 $A_n$ 的覆盖，其总长与下确界之差不超过 $\\varepsilon 2^{-n}$，", "它们的并覆盖 $\\bigcup A_n$，总长 $\\leq \\sum", "\\lambda^*(A_n) + \\varepsilon$。平移不变性：", "将覆盖作平移即可。", "", "长度：只需对 $I = \\intcc ab$ 讨论（其他类型", "仅差端点，端点的外测度为 $0$：用", "很小的区间覆盖；再夹逼 $\\intcc{a+\\varepsilon}{b -", "\\varepsilon} \\subseteq \\intoo ab$ 型的比较）。", "$\\lambda^*(\\intcc ab) \\leq b - a$：用", "$\\intoo{a-\\varepsilon}{b+\\varepsilon}$ 覆盖。反之设 $\\intcc", "ab \\subseteq \\bigcup_n\\intoo{a_n}{b_n}$：由", "\\emph{紧性}（博雷尔–勒贝格，", "\\cref{thm:b3:topology:metriccompact}），有限个区间即可，", "记为 $I_1, \\dots, I_N$。证明 $\\sum_{k\\leq N}(b_k -", "a_k) \\geq b - a$，对 $N$ 归纳：取 $I_{k_1} \\ni a$；若", "$b_{k_1} > b$，则已证（$b_{k_1} - a_{k_1} > b - a$）；否则", "线段 $\\intcc{b_{k_1}}b$ 由其余 $N - 1$ 个", "区间覆盖，由归纳假设得 $\\sum_{k \\neq k_1}(b_k - a_k)", "\\geq b - b_{k_1}$，而 $b_{k_1} - a_{k_1} > b_{k_1} - a$，", "相加即得。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[勒贝格测度]\\label{thm:b3:measure:lebesgue}", "$\\R$ 中每个博雷尔集都是 $\\lambda^*$-可测的。", "$\\lambda$ 是 $\\lambda^*$ 在", "$\\sigma$-代数 $\\mathcal L = \\mathcal M_{\\lambda^*} \\supseteq \\mathcal B(\\R)$", "（即\\emph{勒贝格 $\\sigma$-代数}）上的限制，是", "$\\mathcal B(\\R)$ 上唯一把每个区间映为其长度的测度；它是", "平移不变且 $\\sigma$-有限。", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "由\\cref{thm:b3:measure:caratheodory}，只需证明每条", "射线 $A = \\intoo{-\\infty}c$ 是 $\\lambda^*$-可测的", "（射线生成 $\\mathcal B$，", "\\cref{def:b3:measure:borel}）。设 $E \\subseteq \\R$ 满足", "$\\lambda^*(E) < \\infty$，且 $\\bigcup I_n \\supseteq E$ 为覆盖，", "使得 $\\sum\\ell(I_n) \\leq \\lambda^*(E) + \\varepsilon$。每个", "$I_n$ 分为两个区间 $I_n' = I_n \\cap A$ 与", "$I_n'' = I_n\\setminus A$（区间减去射线仍是", "区间），且 $\\ell(I_n') + \\ell(I_n'') = \\ell(I_n)$；", "$I_n'$ 覆盖 $E \\cap A$，$I_n''$ 覆盖 $E \\setminus A$", "（将每个区间扩大为长为 $\\ell +", "\\varepsilon2^{-n}$ 的开区间，以符合定义），于是", "\\[", "\\lambda^*(E\\cap A) + \\lambda^*(E\\setminus A)", "\\leq \\sum_n\\bigl(\\ell(I_n') + \\ell(I_n'')\\bigr) + 2\\varepsilon", "\\leq \\lambda^*(E) + 3\\varepsilon .", "\\]", "唯一性：两个在", "区间的 $\\pi$-系 $\\intoc ab$ 上（其上有限）与长度一致的测度，", "在 $\\sigma(\\text{区间}) = \\mathcal B$ 上也一致，由", "\\cref{thm:b3:measure:uniqueness}，取 $P_k = \\intoc{-k}k$。", "$\\sigma$-有限性：$\\R = \\bigcup(-k, k]$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[正则性]\\label{thm:b3:measure:regularity}", "对每个 $A \\in \\mathcal L$：\\index{勒贝格测度的", "正则性}", "\\[", "\\lambda(A) = \\inf\\{\\lambda(U) : U \\supseteq A \\text{ 开}\\}", "= \\sup\\{\\lambda(K) : K \\subseteq A \\text{ 紧}\\}.", "\\]", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "\\emph{外正则性}：覆盖 $\\bigcup I_n$ 满足 $\\sum\\ell(I_n) \\leq", "\\lambda(A) + \\varepsilon$，则其并为开集 $U \\supseteq A$，且", "$\\lambda(U) \\leq \\lambda(A) + \\varepsilon$（由次可加性）；若", "$\\lambda(A) = \\infty$，结论显然成立。\\emph{内正则性}：", "先设 $A$ 有界，$A \\subseteq [-M, M]$。取开集", "$U \\supseteq ([-M,M]\\setminus A)$，使 $\\lambda(U) \\leq", "\\lambda([-M,M]\\setminus A) + \\varepsilon$；则 $K = [-M,", "M]\\setminus U$ 为紧集，$K \\subseteq A$，且", "\\[", "\\lambda(K) = \\lambda([-M,M]) - \\lambda([-M,M]\\cap U)", "\\geq \\lambda([-M,M]) - \\bigl(\\lambda([-M,M]) - \\lambda(A) +", "\\varepsilon\\bigr) = \\lambda(A) - \\varepsilon .", "\\]", "一般的 $A$：$\\lambda(A) = \\lim_M\\lambda(A\\cap[-M,M])$", "（由下连续性），并对其应用有界情形。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{example}\\label{ex:b3:measure:cantor}", "康托尔集（见\\cref{exo:b3:topology:10}）满足 $\\lambda(C) = 0$：", "$C \\subseteq C_n$，它是 $2^n$ 个长度为", "$3^{-n}$ 的区间之并，故 $\\lambda(C) \\leq (2/3)^n \\to 0$。一个不可数的", "零测集 --- 基数并不反映测度。反之，", "\\emph{肥康托尔集}（见\\cref{exo:b3:measure:5}）是无处", "稠密但测度为正：拓扑同样不能反映测度。", "周末问题把这种相互作用推向其", "惊人的结论：存在勒贝格可测集，它们", "不是博雷尔集。", "\\end{example}", ""]}